From: mscharged-port native compiler compatibility
Subject: [PATCH] Declare the existing ODE array memory calls for native compilation
Upstream-base: 8b0505a47990d684d1588749f40babb9c0483490

Native declaration include only. No dArray method, record, copy size, allocation
request, source flow or camera state is changed. Console projection is exact.

diff --git a/src/ode/array.h b/src/ode/array.h
